    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "(oral)\n1. An application under Section 378 (III) of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 for grant of Leave to Appeal against the Order dated 21.12.2019 vide which the respondent/accused has been acquitted for the offence punishable under Section 376 IPC read with Section 6 of POCSO Act, 2012 in FIR No.484/2013, Police Station R.K. Puram, Delhi.",
